    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n41 Fairview Close is a superb two-bedroom top floor apartment presented in excellent condition throughout. Located in the Fairview Close development, this property benefits from a prime location and is sure to appeal to first time buyers, investors or those wishing to downsize.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with a large storage closet and a hot press. The living/dining room is open plan to the kitchen and benefits from uniterrupted views thanks to its top floor setting. There are two good size double bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes. The first bedroom has the added benefit of an ensuite. The modern bathroom completes the accommodation of this fine apartment.\nThe property benefits from one designated underground parking space and storage locker. Residents also benefit from well maintained communal areas, including a shared rooftop terrace and a common garden\n\n41 Fairview Close is in an excellent location. Situated between Drumcondra and Fairview villages, there are many cafes, bars, shops, and restaurants in the area. Fairview Park is also a short walk away from the property. Clontarf dart station, Drumcondra train station and many bus routes are located close by connecting the property to the City Centre and other areas in the capital. Dublin City University, Dublin City Centre, M50 and Dublin Airport are short commute away. Viewing is highly recommended.\nIf you would like a viewing of this property, please email us at Drumcondra@sherryfitz.ie or call the office directly on 018373737 to arrange an appointment. If you wish to place an offer, please visit www.sherryfitz.ie where you can register to make an offer on this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.82m x 1.24m\nWelcoming entrance hall with new flooring and large walk in storage space.\n\nLiving/ Dining Room - 5.04m x 3.84m\nSuperb open plan room that enjoys uninterrupted views due to its top floor setting.\n\nKitchen - 2.70m x 1.88m\nWith wall and floor units, tiled floor and splashback, oven and four ring hob, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.30m x 2.90m\nLarge double bedroom with new wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite - 1.58m x 1.52m\nFully tiled with wc, whb, shower, recessed lighting and extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.02m x 2.92m\nSpacious double bedroom with new wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.20m x 1.78m\nFully tiled bathroom with wc, whb, bath with shower attachment, recessed lighting and extractor fan.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious two-bedroom apartment </li><li>Top floor</li><li>Presented in excellent condition, walls freshly painted</li><li>New wood floors throughout, except for bathroom and kitchen where they are tiled.</li><li>Ample storage space</li><li>One designated underground parking space </li><li>Underground storage locker</li><li>Lift</li><li>Rooftop terrace and a common garden</li><li>Excellent location close to abundance of amenities</ul>"
      },
      {
